{
  "accepted_reasons": {
    "construct_runtime_variants": "Regenerated after the Northern Swarm / Reactor merge (PR #519) added `NorthernSwarm: pallet_northern_swarm` to every variant, and again on 2026-09-30 after the X3 guardian wiring commit f4c13ea25 appended `X3AppRegistry`, `X3SecurityGate` and `X3TrustGate` to every variant. Both are index-renumbering changes for every pallet declared after them, which is exactly what this baseline is for; they are accepted here because those commits are the changes that introduced them and no chain runs this runtime yet (`transaction_version` stays 1: no existing call's encoding moved). Appending at the end of each variant leaves every pre-existing pallet index where it was.",
    "runtime_version.spec_version": "The baseline was seeded at spec_version 10 and never regenerated, because the gate could not run: `sp_version::RuntimeVersion` dropped `state_version` in the pinned polkadot-sdk revision and the script required it, so every invocation exited before comparing anything. Regenerated 2026-09-27 at 20, which is the value `docs/reports/runtime-wasm-reproducibility.md` records across v10-v20 (v20 removed the unsigned `submit_finalization_result`).",
    "runtime_version.state_version": "Absent from the source in the pinned revision; the field no longer exists in `sp_version::RuntimeVersion`. `system_version` replaces it here.",
    "runtime_version.system_version": "Present from the v20 source (1).",
    "signed_extra": "Unchanged in content and order; recorded here because the seeded baseline predates the two X3 checks (`InvariantCheck`, `AgentLawCheck`) that the source now carries."
  },
